OL,3,ALegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,4,AStewart dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award-winning star of stage and
OL,7,Fscreen had a career spanning decades -
OL,8,Ffrom the Royal Shakespeare Company, to
OL,9,Fthe X-Men franchise
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
